## 8. Token limits

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| `max_model_len` | 40960 |
| Safe `max_tokens` | 4096 |
| Hard cap per reply | `40960 - prompt_tokens` |
| Do not use | `300000` |

Long C++ / long files: keep `max_tokens=4096` and continue in a loop. One call will not emit 3000 lines.

